---
import Eyebrow from "./Eyebrow.astro";
---

<section class="workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title">
  <div class="workflow__copy">
    <Eyebrow label="Start anywhere" />
    <h2 id="workflow-title">Talk to thndrs like any other agent.</h2>
    <p>
      Thndrs loads the relevant <code>AGENTS.md</code> guidance, and any installed skills you have before connecting to your
      preferred model.
    </p>
    <a class="workflow__link" href="/docs/usage/project-context/">
      Read about project context
      <span class="i-ri-arrow-right-up-line" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <ol class="workflow__steps">
    <li>
      <span>1</span>
      <div><code>cd path/to/project</code><p>Open the repository you want the agent to understand.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>2</span>
      <div><code>thndrs</code><p>First run walks you through provider and model setup.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span>3</span>
      <div><code>Ask for a change.</code><p>Steer the run as needed, then inspect the diff and transcript.</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<style>
  .workflow {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(0, 1.1fr);
    gap: clamp(4rem, 8vw, 6.25rem);
    width: min(var(--thndrs-content-width), calc(100% - 3rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding: 4rem 3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--thndrs-border-strong);
    border-radius: 1.625rem;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 0 0, color-mix(in srgb, var(--thndrs-purple) 10%, transparent), transparent 24rem),
      var(--thndrs-bg);
    box-shadow: 0 1.625rem 4.375rem color-mix(in srgb, var(--thndrs-bg-dark) 42%, transparent);
  }

  .workflow h2 {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 4.6vw, 4.4rem);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    line-height: 1.04;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .workflow__copy > p {
    max-width: 30rem;
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .workflow__copy code,
  .workflow__steps code {
    color: var(--thndrs-fg);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-mono);
  }

  .workflow__link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    margin-top: 1.375rem;
    color: var(--thndrs-green);
    font-weight: 650;
    text-decoration-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--thndrs-green) 32%, transparent);
    text-underline-offset: 0.3125rem;
  }

  .workflow__link span {
    width: 1.0625rem;
    height: 1.0625rem;
    margin-left: 0.5rem;
  }

  .workflow__steps {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .workflow__steps li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.375rem 1fr;
    gap: 1.125rem;
    padding-block: 1.875rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--thndrs-border);
  }

  .workflow__steps li:first-child {
    padding-top: 0;
  }

  .workflow__steps li:last-child {
    border: 0;
  }

  .workflow__steps li > span {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2rem;
    height: 2rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--thndrs-bg-highlight);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px color-mix(in srgb, var(--thndrs-cyan) 20%, transparent);
    color: var(--thndrs-cyan);
    font-family: var(--thndrs-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .workflow__steps p {
    margin: 0.5625rem 0 0;
    color: var(--thndrs-fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.91rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 56rem) {
    .workflow {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4.5rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 40rem) {
    .workflow {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 4.25rem 1.75rem;
      border-inline: 0;
      border-radius: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
